 chodba s vestavěnými skříněmi. Nahoře je velká otevřená galerie s ložnicí a terasou s úložnou komorou. \r\n\r\nKlimatizace, velkoformátová dlažba, koberec v horním patře, dostatek vestavěných úložných prostor a nábytku, plynový kotel, pračka, sušička, kuchyňské spotřebiče zn. Siemens, myčka, indukční varná deska, drtič odpadu, alarm, sklep.","detail_done":true,"disp":"5+1","district":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-27","floor":5,"floors_total":null,"furnished":"no","garage":null,"heating":null,"history":[["2026-10-27",75000]],"id":"sreality-3275149388","images":["https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeBPfwtLPLIJdOQo/d93b.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUChHuMCMOIJdOYm/a613.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUD8nezBaiIJdOiI/ee35.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUCHypVCKFIJdOqO/a34e.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUBiA4qCL8IJdOyO/6e90.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUChHuMCMOIJdO6N/d89f.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeD7yCdiSAIJdPEA/f5de.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeushhHlLIJdPL5/83bb.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUBL8BsH5KIJdPT6/8723.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeCdpo1LmDIJdPcB/9f6d.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUCHypVCI1IJdPkH/a278.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEe0kCSH3BIJdPsX/9eb9.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeDb3WcHrFIJdP0g/ac8e.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUB854tCqkIJdP8d/a0e3.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUD9QxwCEXIJdQGm/edef.jpeg?fl=res,1024,768,1","https://d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeushhHlXIJdQOz/08a5.jp